| ETHUSDT 4h, multi-year pre-2025 validation |       8 or 10 |         70 or 252 | 8 is practical; 10 is stronger if fold size remains adequate. |
| Crypto 1h                                  |      10 or 12 |        252 or 924 | Cap combinations if compute/reporting is heavy.               |
| Crypto/perp 15m                            |      12 or 16 |     924 or 12,870 | Use deterministic subset of combinations if needed.           |
| FX 4h                                      |        6 or 8 |          20 or 70 | Must be session-aware; avoid weekend artifacts.               |
| FX 15m/1h                                  |      10 or 12 |        252 or 924 | Session-aware folds required.                                 |

Minimum acceptable:

```text
